  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Quality Living: Inclusive Systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to improve rights and participation of people with disabilities, with a primary focus on mental health and psychosocial disabilities in Kenya (Kilifi District) and Zimbabwe (Chimanimani and Chipinge Districts). The project activities include disability training, awareness raising on disability inclusion, training of trainers and capacity building for local government staff on disability inclusion, economic empowerment, mental health and psychosocial support.</narrative>
  </description>
